            <ArticleTitle>Novel method of coronary stent delivery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>87-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Occasionally a coronary stent cannot be delivered. In this case, a dislodged stent was purposely pushed forward by the delivery balloon into position; a smaller, compliant balloon was used for initial deployment; and the original stent-delivery balloon was used for subsequent final deployment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
